### Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Start "Serve API on :8080" first,
### then click "Send Request" above each block.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Critical: password reset (send twice -- the Idempotency-Key dedupes it)
POST {{base}}/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pwreset-user-42

{ "channel": "email", "recipient": "user42@example.com", "subject": "Reset your password",
  "body": "Click here to reset...", "priority": "critical" }

### Critical SMS to an invalid number (-> FAILED, no retries)
POST {{base}}/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "sms", "recipient": "invalid-number", "body": "Code: 123456", "priority": 1 }

### Batch marketing
POST {{base}}/v1/notifications/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{ "notifications": [
  { "channel": "email", "recipient": "a@example.com", "subject": "Sale", "body": "50% off", "priority": 3 },
  { "channel": "push",  "recipient": "device-abc",   "body": "Deal of the day", "priority": "marketing" }
] }

### Status + audit trail (paste an id from a response above)
GET {{base}}/v1/notifications/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Stats
GET {{base}}/v1/stats
